    <ferc:AttestationName id="f-326" contextRef="c-02">T.J. Winczewski</ferc:AttestationName>
    <ferc:AttestationTitle id="f-327" contextRef="c-02">Vice President</ferc:AttestationTitle>
    <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="f-329" contextRef="c-02">&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="Section_1"&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos; font-weight: bold; background-color: unset; font-size: 1em; text-align: inherit"&gt;The Company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="Section_1"&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;Rio Grande Pipeline Company LLC (the &amp;quot;Company&amp;quot;), a Texas limited liability company, is a wholly owned subsidiary of Enterprise Products Operating LLC, a Texas limited liability company (&amp;quot;EPOLLC&amp;quot;). EPOLLC in turn is wholly owned by Enterprise Products Partners L.P. (&amp;quot;Enterprise&amp;quot;), a Delaware limited partnership, which is a publicly traded partnership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;EPOLLC is the operator of the Company.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos; font-weight: bold"&gt;Description of the Property&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;The Company owns a 249-mile 8-inch natural gas liquids (NGL) pipeline that originates near Odessa, Texas in Ector County. The Company transports propane/butane mix to a Pemex-owned interconnect at the Mexican border south of El Paso, Texas in addition to an Enterprise-owned Terminal in El Paso, Texas.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos; font-weight: bold"&gt;Basis of Accounting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;The accounting policies followed in preparation of these financial statements conform to those required by FERC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt; Financial statements are prepared on the accrual basis of accounting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt; Property, plant and equipment assets are recorded at original cost.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos; font-weight: bold"&gt;Revenue Recognition&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;Revenues are derived from transportation of NGLs under interstate and intrastate tariffs. The tariffs specify the amounts to be paid by shippers for service between receipt and delivery locations and the general terms and conditions of transportation services on the pipeline system. Revenue is recognized upon delivery of product to shippers.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos; font-weight: bold"&gt;Income Taxes&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;The Company is a limited liability company that passes income tax liability through the company to EPOLLC and, with the exception of the Texas Franchise Tax, if applicable, does not recognize this liability on the company's financial statements. For purposes of calculating income taxes for the annual cost of service (shown on page 700 of the Annual Report), the Company employs FERC's Policy Statement on Income Tax Allowances.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos; font-weight: bold"&gt;Employees&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;The Company does not have any employees. All operations, management, and administrative functions are performed by employees of Enterprise Products Company on behalf of EPOLLC, as operator.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;The Company reimburses EPOLLC for management and administrative functions under the terms of an operating agreement.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 116%"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Aptos"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 		&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
    <ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock id="f-331" contextRef="c-02">&lt;div class="Section_1"&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Arial"&gt;1) None&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Arial"&gt;2) None&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Arial"&gt;3) None&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Arial"&gt;4) None&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-family: Arial"&gt;5) N/A&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 		&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock>
